  "expected": {
    "outcome": "failure",
    "error_code": "IDENTITY_FAILED",
    "rationale": "`identity.type` is `oidc`, so pinned-key verification MUST NOT run (§3.2 step 1), and the OIDC path rejects a descriptor carrying `public_key` (§1). `proof` is not a JWT. A verifier that dispatches on the presence of `public_key` rather than on `type` would verify the pinned proof and accept; that is the type-confusion defect this fixture catches."
